# Design skill routing

| User intent | Skill |
|-------------|-------|
| Investor pitch, fundraising, demo day, accelerator deck | `pitch-deck-architect` then `presentation-architect` |
| McKinsey/BCG/Bain consulting, strategy, board, DD, RFP | `management-consultant-deck` then `presentation-architect` |
| Business PPT, slides, PowerPoint (general) | `presentation-architect` |
| Sales deck, board update, internal business update | `presentation-architect` (+ consulting skill if strategy-heavy) |
| LinkedIn / Instagram carousel | `carousel-architect` |
| Product demo video, explainer MP4, launch trailer, social clip | `demo-video-remotion` + `vinayak-remotion-video` + `remotion-best-practices` |
| Premium Remotion motion / layout / pacing craft | `vinayak-remotion-video` + `remotion-best-practices` |
| Polish existing UI | `impeccable` |
| Map design docs / content | `graphify` on `design-systems/` or brief folder |
